{
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(git add *)",
      "Bash(git commit *)",
      "Bash(git push *)",
      "Bash(git add:*)",
      "Bash(git commit -m ':*)",
      "Bash(git push:*)"
    ],
    "deny": [
      "Read(./.env)",
      "Read(./.env.*)",
      "Read(./secrets/**)",
      "Read(./credentials.json)",
      "Read(./**/*.pem)",
      "Read(./**/id_rsa*)"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/block-secrets.sh" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/post-edit-ruff.sh" }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "startup|resume",
        "hooks": [
          { "type": "command", "command": "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/session-start-context.sh" }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "autoMode": {
    "environment": [
      "### Project: dome_pad",
      "**Purpose**: The Yellow Pad touchscreen gamepad for the DOME robot: ESP32 firmware plus joy/teleop, rosbridge and pad_buttons",
      "**Package manager**: ROS 2 colcon (ament_python); PlatformIO via uvx for firmware/",
      "**Run**: bl dome_pad robot.launch.py (Pi) / remote.launch.py (VM), or dome2's pad subsystem (p)",
      "**Test**: /usr/bin/python3 -m pytest test/ (Pi/VM), PYTHONPATH=. uvx pytest test/ (Mac)",
      "**Source control**: https://github.com/Boston-Robot-Hackers/dome_pad, public",
      "**Protected branches**: main"
    ],
    "allow": [
      "$defaults"
    ]
  }
}
